.SS Required
.IP \(bu 2
Python 3.9 or later
.IP \(bu 2
Git
.SS Optional
.IP \(bu 2
Ollama (for AI commit message generation)
.IP \(bu 2
GitHub CLI (gh) (for pull_repos)
