.SH NOTES
.SS Conventional Commits
The AI-generated commit messages follow the Conventional Commits specification:
.PP
.RS
<type>(<scope>): <subject>
.RE
.PP
Where type is one of: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build,
ci, chore, revert.
.SS Performance
The
.B ai_commit
binary is written in Go for optimal performance, while the management tools
use Python for rich terminal UI capabilities.
.SS Terminal Support
The Rich library is used for terminal output. For best results, use a terminal
emulator that supports Unicode and 256 colors.